Package: BANCproject
Title: Analysis Pipeline for the BANC Connectome Paper
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alexander S.", "Bates",   role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "alexander.shakeel.bates@gmail.com"),
    person("Jasper S.",   "Phelps",   role = "aut"),
    person("Minsu",       "Kim",      role = "aut"),
    person("Helen H.",    "Yang",     role = "aut"),
    person("BANC-FlyWire", "Consortium", role = "ctb"))
Description: Source code accompanying Bates, Phelps, Kim, Yang et al.
    (2026), 'Distributed control circuits across a brain-and-cord
    connectome'. Builds every figure and text-output reported in the
    paper from a bundled per-neuron metadata snapshot and the larger
    data products hosted on the Harvard Dataverse deposit
    (doi:10.7910/DVN/7WTH1N). Not a CRAN package — this DESCRIPTION
    exists so that `devtools::install_deps()` resolves the runtime
    dependencies in a reproducible way.
